{"id":"cuello","lemma":"cuello","pos":"noun","rank":871,"glosses":["neck (part of body connecting the head and the torso)","collar (part of a shirt fitting around the neck)"],"ipa":"/ˈkweʝo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cuellos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rodelar-cuello.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me duele el cuello.","en":"My neck hurts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501323"},{"text":"Las ranas no tienen cuello.","en":"Frogs don't have necks.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831405"},{"text":"Tom se aflojó su cuello.","en":"Tom loosened his collar.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803566"},{"text":"Tu cuello tiene una mancha.","en":"Your collar has a stain on it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587465"},{"text":"¿Cómo está el cuello de Tom?","en":"How's Tom's neck?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/798380"}]}